<section background-color="heading">
  <grid spacing="none">
    <grid-item colspan="39" vertical-align="center">
      <p role="eyebrow">Leadership operating loop</p>
      <h2>Close the loop: decide, measure, adapt</h2>
      <p><b>Today:</b> approve, adjust, or defer the three proposed choices.</p>
      <p font-size="sm"><b>Illustrative example — not company data.</b></p>
      <smart-layout variant="cycle">
        <smart-layout-item>
          <ai-icon query="executive decision approval"></ai-icon>
          <h4>Decide today</h4>
          <p>Set the interventions and owners.</p>
        </smart-layout-item>
        <smart-layout-item>
          <ai-icon query="thirty day operating review"></ai-icon>
          <h4>Measure at day 30</h4>
          <p>Report staffing, pricing compliance, pipeline coverage, and onboarding time.</p>
        </smart-layout-item>
        <smart-layout-item>
          <ai-icon query="leadership contingency review"></ai-icon>
          <h4>Adapt at day 60</h4>
          <p>Review retention trajectory and release contingency capacity if triggers are breached.</p>
        </smart-layout-item>
        <smart-layout-item>
          <ai-icon query="balanced business outcomes assessment"></ai-icon>
          <h4>Assess at quarter end</h4>
          <p>Judge durable growth across revenue, margin, retention, and cash—not growth alone.</p>
        </smart-layout-item>
      </smart-layout>
    </grid-item>
    <grid-item colspan="21" padding="20pt" vertical-align="end" background-overlay="tint" background-overlay-intensity="0.2">
      <ai-image background="true" image-style="causal-model-studio" aspect-ratio="portrait" prompt="Editorial studio photograph of a closed-loop tabletop operating model made from matte warm-white card and machined aluminum, four linked stations connected by a continuous graphite rail, one signal-red decision lever and restrained green indicators showing protected value returning to the starting gate, crisp directional light, no text, lettering, screens, logos, or people."/>
      <p role="caption">Concept imagery · not company evidence.</p>
    </grid-item>
  </grid>
</section>